    that snapshot. All existing registry identities have the anchor version
    as their latest published version.
    
    The release set contains 76 publishable packages. Packages without
    unpublished content or required dependency changes keep their versions.
    The scope includes arty_tokio 0.2.0 for its exposed Arty Context type
    and tick 0.9.0 for timer and clock API changes. The Metabench 0.3.0
    family updates generated Gungraun 0.20 inputs. The data_privacy 0.13.2
