    `dispatch::{client, core}`, and asynchronous thread startup in
    `asynchronous::start`.
    - Let `Runtime` own the single-use `WorkerJoiner`.
    - Require the runtime owner to stay on an external thread.
    `Runtime::stop` and `Runtime` destruction panic on Arty workers.
    - Reject `RuntimeScheduler::block_on` from asynchronous and blocking
    workers before task submission.
    - Keep timer advancement and wait budgets on precise system time.
    
