    The asynchronous worker samples precise system time after each executor
    cycle. It uses this sample to advance timers. Before a timer wait, it
    takes a fresh sample to calculate the wait budget. Controlled clocks
    remain externally owned. Final shutdown timer callbacks also use a fresh
    precise system-time sample.
    
