    <summary>Validation limits</summary>
    
    Windows ARM execution and native WinHTTP timings remain unverified
    locally. Common HTTP body benchmarks do not measure native transport
    I/O. Full coverage, mutation, and runtime-analysis tiers were not run
    locally. Minimum-dependency resolution encounters an existing conflict
    between the workspace's `rustc-hash` minimum and `internity`'s exact
    pin.
    
    </details>
    
