    methods and the redundant
    <code>parking_lot</code> <code>const_*</code> constructor functions; the
    corresponding <code>new</code>
    methods can be called in constant contexts. (<a
    href="https://redirect.github.com/Amanieu/parking_lot/issues/533">#533</a>)</li>
    <li>Replaced the recursive read methods on <code>RwLock</code> with a
    dedicated reader-biased
    <code>RecursiveRwLock</code> type. The <code>RawRwLockRecursive</code>
