    href="https://redirect.github.com/Amanieu/parking_lot/issues/533">#533</a>)</li>
    <li>Made additional lock, timeout, parking, and spin-wait accessors
    usable in
    constant contexts. (<a
    href="https://redirect.github.com/Amanieu/parking_lot/issues/533">#533</a>)</li>
    <li>Added <code>into_inner_with_raw</code> to <code>lock_api</code>'s
    <code>Mutex</code>, <code>RwLock</code>, and
