    bookkeeping and initialized OnceLock/LazyLock paths. Keep enabled
    recording covered by dedicated telemetry tests.
    - Try ready queue, oneshot, watch and Async-barrier operations before
    creating blocking adapters. Preserve the original finite timeout budget,
    one contention event and one barrier arrival. Empty native Condvar
    notifications and one-participant barriers have direct fast paths.
    - Add Sync/Async Notify with a retained/coalesced permit, waiter
    enablement, cancellation handoff and blocking/async waits. Use it for
    Arty worker signaling while preserving main's deadline-driven timers and
    tests for sleeping and waking runtime threads.
