    workloads and public edge-case coverage informed by the std/Tokio test
    audit.
    
    ### Review follow-up
    
    Finite elapsed-time budgets handle durations that overflow Instant
    without becoming unlimited waits. Notify records its signal before
    reentrant wake delivery; monitor/thread/report labels distinguish permit
    misses from physical blocking. Controlled
    registration/expiry/spurious-wake tests, queued cancellation and
    reentrant telemetry-order tests cover these paths. The portable
    poison-notification test rechecks its predicate after a spurious wake.
    
