    with identical controls and setup outside timing. The empty-Condvar
    group no longer compares against retained Tokio permits. Target-specific
    size reporting replaces unsupported relative-layout assertions;
    allocation guarantees have explicit recording/payload/waker/platform
    boundaries.
    
