    explicit required features for the five new telemetry test targets. The
    watch harness uses many_cpus discovery and unchanged sample boundaries
    and workload cases. Its initial driver-free Tick stopwatch was replaced
    by `std::time::Instant` in **37b22763**, because Tick itself depends on
