    Port the allocator test's at-least-once drain, the safe active/retired
    recorder-buffer fixture, nine standalone blocking-channel benchmarks,
    blocking-first barrier regressions and generation assertions, and
    Miri-eligible ready/blocking telemetry coverage.
    
