    ## Summary
    
    Integrates the I/O hosting contract from #840 into the Arty runtime.
    This is the upper layer of the native stack: #840 extracts the unstable
    `arty_io_host` implementation utility and updates `arty_io_core`; this
    PR contains only the Arty runtime integration.
    
    The implementation adapts the earlier design work in martintmk/oxidizer
    commit
    [`f963b73`](https://github.com/martintmk/oxidizer/commit/f963b7390c1f3ed39d3bdf13dc9c44c27100b97b)
