    - adds an `arty_io` example and updates the I/O guide and generated
    crate README
    - keeps `arty_io_host` positioned as unstable Arty implementation
    infrastructure in the lower PR
    - adds public integration coverage for registration, role assignment,
    cycles, wakeups, external access, relocation, failures, telemetry, and
    teardown
    
