    Earlier **pre-rebase** measurements compared canonical v4 without
    telemetry to the same telemetry-compiled candidate with recording
    off/on. These are not measurements of the final rebased PR binary.
    Windows x86-64, release/fat LTO, 12 balanced fresh-process samples;
    recording-on samples omitted stacks.
    
    | Workload | Original v4, ns/item | Recording off | Recording on | Off
    vs. original |
