    | Local 16 B | 8.67 | 8.75 | 155.45 | +0.9% |
    | Local 48 B | 8.77 | 8.70 | 155.78 | -0.8% |
    | Local 96 B | 8.70 | 8.83 | 154.70 | +1.5% |
