    | `SocketNoDelay` | `SocketOptions::no_delay` |
    | `SocketReceiveBufferSizeInBytes` |
    `SocketOptions::receive_buffer_size` |
    | `SocketSendBufferSizeInBytes` | `SocketOptions::send_buffer_size` |
