    `#[derive(Error)]` rejects enums, which is the first question anyone migrating from `thiserror` asks, since its headline pattern is an enum with one variant per failure condition. The `Structs only` section of `docs/COMPARISON.md` answers it in one sentence, with nothing to look at.
    
