    version. The version is deliberately 0.5.0 rather than 0.4.0, so the
    crate does not publish a version that nothing consumes; `ohno` and
    `ohno_macros` stay at 0.4.0. The root `Cargo.toml` requirement and the
    `Cargo.lock` entry both read 0.5.0 to match.
