    entry points. Each test snapshots the expansion, pretty-printed with
    `prettyplease`, so a snapshot records the generated Rust. Faults are
    snapshotted the same way, which pins the diagnostic text.
    - Group related inputs into one snapshot under `// === label ===`
    headers. 20 snapshot files replace the 50 the crate carried before.
    - Remove the out-of-range guard in `derive_error::model::Shape::new`.
    `validate::select_core` only yields indices from `ast.fields`.
    `validate` maps that same list one-to-one into `fields`. `Shape::new`
