    ## Root cause
    Commit 9afbe27 (#638) introduced three `rallocator` tests whose
    allocations had no observable effect under optimization. In the release
    profile, LLVM elided those allocations, so the tests deterministically
    failed on both Windows and Linux. The Cargo test task then exited 100;
