    - `cargo test -p tick --all-features`: **143 unit + 54 doctests pass**.
    - `cargo clippy -p tick --all-features --all-targets -- -D warnings`:
    clean.
    - `cargo doc -p tick --all-features`: clean.
    - No-default-features build OK; `just spellcheck` passes; formatted with
    `just format`.
    
