    ## Problem
    
    The `Udeps` step in `.github/workflows/main.yml` ran `cargo udeps
    --all-features --workspace` **without `--all-targets`**. `cargo udeps`
    only analyzes dev-dependencies when `--all-targets` (or
    `--tests/--benches/--examples`) is passed — otherwise it checks lib/bins
