    `Display`, `to_uri_string()`, `into_uri()`; swapped meanings of
    `template()` and
    `format_template()`.
    - **Re-exports** — removed the `http` re-export module. `Authority` and
    `Scheme` are now re-exported at the crate root; `Parts` is no longer
