    refactor: Make CacheTier::len()/is_empty() async (#350)
    
    Some types of distributed caches will need to make async calls. To
    prepare for that and to make it non-blocking this change converts
    `CacheTier::len()` to async. This is high priority because it is a
    breaking API change, and it needs to get made before we really start to
    onboard consumers. Making this change requires many updates to existing
    tests, and to implementations of `CacheTier`.
    
    Since len() is used on every insert and invalidate to record the size of
    the cache to telemetry, this change also removes `record_size` until we
    can refactor it into configuration, instead of calling it on every
    `insert`.

